        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SDLA/SDAR, Heavy Duty Solid Brass Double Pocket Door Privacy Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Double Pocket Door Privacy Lock Set comes with everything you need to install on a set of sliding French Doors to secure them together. Both have a flip up edge pull so you can easily get doors out of their pockets. The Deltana SDLA/SDAR Sliding Door Privacy Lock is for doors that may need to be locked for privacy--such as those found leading into bedrooms and bathrooms. It has an easy emergency release. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDLASDAR.jpg?v=1704354589\" width=\"600\" height=\"135\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana SDLA325 Pocket Door Privacy Set Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe privacy lock is installed on one door while the receiver is installed on the other door. When locked, the two pocket doors are tightly hooked together.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-privacy-pocket-door-lock-deltana-sdla325\"><b>Single Pocket Door Privacy Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-passage-pocket-door-pull-deltana-sdpa325\"><b>Single Pocket Door Passage Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SDLA/SDAR Sliding French Pocket Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lock Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Receiver Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Receiver Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout: 2-3/4\" High by 1-3/4\" Deep </li>\r\n<li>Emergency lock release on outside.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDLASDAR-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262320\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SDLASDAR Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDLA325-install.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\"><b>Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on double (french) pocket sliding doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Double Pocket Door Privacy Lock Set, Deltana SDLA/SDAR",
                "description": "Deltana SDLA/SDAR, Double Pocket Door Privacy Lock Set - The Double Pocket Door Privacy Lock Set comes with everything you need to install on a set of sliding French Doors to secure them together. Both have a flip up edge pull so you can easily get doors out of their pockets. The Deltana SDLA/SDAR Sliding Door Privacy Lock is for doors that may need to be locked for privacy--such as those found leading into bedrooms and bathrooms. It has an easy emergency release.",
